WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.640
Speaker 1: All right, let's get into audience&nbsp;
questions for the week, much to discuss today,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:10.240
I got so many messages about this that I will talk&nbsp;
about it. It wasn't part of my coverage on Monday&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:14.480
of Donald Trump's speech because it wasn't&nbsp;
actually something that happened. But I got&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:21.120
so many emails saying, David, is it true&nbsp;
that Donald Trump wore his pants backwards&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:28.160
at that crazy speech in North Carolina? It is&nbsp;
not true. But listen, I understand what's going&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:33.920
on. Trump came up to the stage and we're going to&nbsp;
show a picture of it. And his pants just looked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:37.920
strange. There were weird creases on the&nbsp;
front. It almost looked like there were&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:43.440
like there was no zipper, like there was just a&nbsp;
seam. And there was speculation his pants were&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:48.480
backwards or it was some kind of a mermaid outfit&nbsp;
or he was wearing an elastic waistband. And that's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:53.040
why there was no zipper. I have to tell you, when&nbsp;
I looked at it closely, the wrinkles looked like&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:59.600
Trump had just been sitting and the pants are&nbsp;
wrinkly. And I do see what looks like a zipper&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:05.120
crease, although it's not as noticeable maybe&nbsp;
as some others would, I would imagine it to be.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:10.160
And I didn't for a second think that Donald Trump&nbsp;
wore his pants backwards. This was then looked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:17.520
at by Snopes and Snopes did indeed determine no,&nbsp;
Trump did not wear his pants backward at the rally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:27.360
you asked. So we watched the 90 minute speech and&nbsp;
they found that the photograph simply do not show&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:34.320
that Trump's pants were backwards. Now, it's the&nbsp;
funny thing to me about this is, first of all,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:35.120 --> 00:01:42.480
the idea that we many of us would believe&nbsp;
that Trump might wear his pants backwards&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:46.640
like that wouldn't be beyond the realm&nbsp;
of possibility. I would believe it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.640 --> 00:01:53.680
It just happened not to have been the case. But&nbsp;
the more interesting thing was how low is the bar&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:57.680
that a lot of the commentary is, including&nbsp;
my own on Twitter, when when I saw this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.680 --> 00:02:05.200
were essentially lizanne, the speech was deranged.&nbsp;
Trump lied throughout it. He told corrosive lies&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:11.200
about democracy. He did all of these things,&nbsp;
but his pants weren't on backwards. And I think&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:16.160
it was Lucas Grindley from The Advocate, if I&nbsp;
recall correctly, who responded to me and said,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:16.720 --> 00:02:23.120
this is how low the bar now is, that we can&nbsp;
say at least the guy's pants were on straight,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:30.320
but no, his pants were forward. I don't&nbsp;
really care about Donald Trump's clothing.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.320 --> 00:02:36.880
I've never understood from a very just practical&nbsp;
perspective, a guy as wealthy as Trump claims&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:41.280
to be or as wealthy as Trump is. They're not&nbsp;
the same thing, but he's still a wealthy guy.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:51.040
How has no one gone to him and said, sir, the full&nbsp;
seat suit look is not in right now. The tailored,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:51.680 --> 00:02:58.640
slimmer fit looks and or maybe they have. And&nbsp;
Trump doesn't look right in the slimmer fit suits.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:58.640 --> 00:03:03.760
I've never understood how a guy this wealthy has&nbsp;
such terrible suits, but I know that Trump's an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:10.960
older guy and that's a style that there are&nbsp;
other older men I know who still like the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:16.640
full seat suit. And that appears to be Trump. But&nbsp;
